{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS2SWvpX6mbnACDMeRyA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your job has been failing silently for two separate reasons, and I fixed the one in your scripts. The other one needs a login fix on your Mac, which I can't do from this snapshot.\n\n1. **The script crashed before it could report anything.** `bin/nightly-review.zsh` assigned `status=$?`, but `status` is read-only in zsh. The script died on that line with exit 1, so neither the failure note nor the success note was ever sent. I renamed the variable to `rc` and sent claude's stderr to a `.err` file, so failure notes now include the reason.\n2. **Claude isn't logged in under launchd.** Every night's error log shows `Not logged in · Please run /login`. The snapshot doesn't show why the credentials aren't available in that context, so this isn't fixed by a code change. ANSWER.md lists how to reproduce it with `launchctl kickstart` and a long-lived token via `claude setup-token`.\n3. **`bin/notify.sh` could fail silently.** If the keychain lookup for the Telegram token failed, the script sent a request with an empty token, Telegram returned 404, and `curl` reported success. It now exits 1 with a message when the token is missing and uses `curl -f`.\n\nI tested the fixed scripts with stub `claude` and `security` commands in a scratch directory, which I then deleted. I did not send any real Telegram message or call the real Claude service. The end-to-end run still needs to happen on your Mac.\n\nThe causes, evidence, and fixes are in `ANSWER.md`. Changed files: `bin/nightly-review.zsh`, `bin/notify.sh`, and the new `ANSWER.md`. Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2058,"cache_read_input_tokens":35839,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2058},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02e5a7a4-c110-4eb1-9e17-98938d928d92","uuid":"3c89fb24-2313-432e-9cc9-c3a632c38872","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:23:41.039Z","request_id":"req_011CgS2SWghLG6Bx9en3uHmt"}
